@startuml UC-06-Memberi-Komentar
title Sequence Diagram: Memberi Komentar

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Detail Materi\ndengan Bagian Komentar\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/komentar\nPUT /api/komentar/:id\nDELETE /api/komentar/:id" as API
participant "KomentarController" as Controller
participant "KomentarService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Komentar)" as DB

== Flow Normal - Menulis Komentar Baru ==

User -> UI: Scroll ke bagian komentar
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan daftar komentar\ndan tombol "Tulis Komentar"
User -> UI: Klik "Tulis Komentar"
UI --> User: Menampilkan textbox komentar
User -> UI: Menulis teks komentar
User -> UI: Klik "Kirim"
UI -> UI: Validasi client-side\n(tidak kosong, max 1000 char)

alt Komentar valid
    UI -> API: POST /api/komentar\n{ idMateri, idPengguna,\nteksKomentar, tanggal }
    activate API
    API -> Controller: createKomentar()
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: saveKomentar(data)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: Validasi server-side\n(tidak kosong, <= 1000 char,\nsanitasi konten)
    
    alt Validasi server berhasil
        Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Komentar\n(idMateri, idPengguna,\nteksKomentar, tanggal)\nVALUES ('[id]', '[userId]',\n'[teks]', NOW())
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: Return idKomentar baru\ndengan data lengkap
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\ndata: {komentar baru} }
        Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Komentar berhasil"
        UI --> User: Render komentar baru\ndi daftar
        UI -> UI: Clear textbox
    else Konten tidak pantas/spam
        Service -> Service: Filter deteksi\nkonten tidak pantas
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Konten tidak pantas" }
        Controller --> API: Response 400 Bad Request
        API --> UI: Error response
        UI --> User: Tampilkan error message
    end
    
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    
else Komentar kosong/terlalu panjang
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error validasi
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Edit Komentar ==

User -> UI: Klik "Edit" pada\nkomentarnya sendiri
activate UI
UI -> UI: Cek kepemilikan\n(idPengguna == current user)
UI --> User: Tampilkan textbox dengan\nteks komentar existing
User -> UI: Mengubah teks
User -> UI: Klik "Simpan Perubahan"
UI -> API: PUT /api/komentar/:id\n{ teksKomentar: "teks baru" }
activate API
API -> Controller: updateKomentar(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: updateKomentar(id, data)
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE Komentar SET\nteksKomentar = '[teks]',\ntanggalEdit = NOW()\nWHERE idKomentar = '[id]'\nAND idPengguna = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Update UI dengan komentar\nyang diubah (label "diedit")
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Hapus Komentar ==

User -> UI: Klik "Hapus" pada\nkomentarnya sendiri
activate UI
UI --> User: Tampilkan konfirmasi\n"Yakin hapus komentar?"
User -> UI: Klik "Ya"
UI -> API: DELETE /api/komentar/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: deleteKomentar(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: deleteKomentar(id, userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Komentar\nWHERE idKomentar = '[id]'\nAND idPengguna = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: DELETE success
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Hapus komentar dari UI\ndengan animasi
UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Komentar berhasil dihapus"
deactivate UI

@enduml
